control: A read the account snapshot cannot trust never replaces it
removes: a read that lists no account keeps the previous snapshot rather than serving none
packages: ./accountload
tests: TestAReloadServesWhatItReadAndKeepsTheLastGoodSnapshotOnAFailedRead
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

diff --git a/accountload/load.go b/accountload/load.go
